<%--
Cache_Id_Override_Test - Verifies cache_id() custom cache-key override

Target: cache_id() override in packages/core/src/component.ts (~751-754, ~954-960)
and packages/core/src/component-cache.ts (generate_cache_key).

A component that defines cache_id() should compute its cache key from that
return value alone - NOT from this.args. Two instances of such a component
with DIFFERENT args but the SAME cache_id() return value must resolve to the
SAME cache entry. A control component (no cache_id()) must resolve to
DIFFERENT cache entries when args differ, as usual.
--%>
<Define:Cache_Id_Override_Test>
  <div>
    <div $sid="mount"></div>
    <div id="results"></div>
  </div>
</Define:Cache_Id_Override_Test>
